A function template DECLARATION followed by its DEFINITION
([temp.over.link]/6), with a parameter pack expanded inside the
trailing-return-type decltype (`std::forward<_Args>(__args)...` --
the libc++ __bind_back shape).  Locks the round-126/127 pair of
fixes: the superseded declaration scope's pack_size_map zero-seeds
are purged on merge (b79138d38c), and the trailing-return temporary
parameter registrations are quarantined in a block scope so they
cannot leak into the enclosing namespace and make the parameter
lookup ambiguous (7a2694d606).
